#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kruler; is a very simple application, with only one aim in life. To measure "
"pixel distances and colors on your screen. It is useful for working on "
"layout of dialogs, web pages &etc;"
msgstr ""
"&kruler;  je veoma jednostavna aplikacija,  sa samo jednom svrhom. A to je "
"da mjeri udaljenost piksela i boje na Vašem zaslonu. To je veoma korisno za "
"izradu rasporeda dijaloga, web stranica &etc;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To start &kruler;, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Applications</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Graphics</guisubmenu> <guisubmenu>More Applications</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Screen Ruler</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from your "
"&kmenu;."
msgstr ""
"Da pokrenete &kruler;, izaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Aplikacije</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Grafika</guisubmenu> <guisubmenu>Više aplikacija</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Lenjir zaslona</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz "
"&kmenu;."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kruler;</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kruler;</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kruler;</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kruler;</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking with the &LMB; on the &kruler; will turn the cursor to a cross with "
"four arrows and enables you to drag &kruler; around the screen."
msgstr ""
"Klik na &LMB; na &kruler; će pretvoriti kurzor u križ sa četiri strelice i "
"omogučiti Vam da prenosite  &kruler; preko zaslona."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you move the mouse over &kruler;, your cursor will turn into an "
"elongated arrow, with a circle at one end. As you move the cursor, &kruler; "
"will display how far from the point marked <guilabel>0</guilabel> the circle "
"on the end of the cursor currently is. &kruler; will also display the &HTML; "
"color code of the color currently under the circle. This is very useful for "
"picking out colors from an image. If you move the mouse far enough that the "
"arrow cursor is no longer touching &kruler;, the cursor will revert to "
"normal, allowing you to carry on working with your other applications."
msgstr ""
"Kada pređete mišem preko &kruler;, Vaš kurzor će se pretvoriti u izduženu "
"strelicu, sa kružićem na kraju. Kako pomjerate kurzor, &kruler; će "
"prikazivati koliko je trenutno kružić na kraju kurzora daleko od tačke sa "
"oznakom <guilabel>0</guilabel>. &kruler; će također prikazati &HTML; kod "
"boje koja je trenutno ispod kružića. Ovo je veoma korisno za odabir boje sa "
"slike. Ako pomjerite miša dovoljno daleko tako da kurzor više ne dodiruje "
"&kruler;, kurzor će se vratiti u normalu, dozvoljavajući Vam da nastavite "
"raditi sa drugim aplikacijama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can change the orientation in three different ways:"
msgstr "Možete promijeniti orjentaciju u tri različita smjera:"

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking the &MMB; switches the ruler from vertical to horizontal orientation"
msgstr ""
"Klik na &MMB; mijenja lenjir iz vertikalne u horizontalnu orijentaciju."

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By clicking the rotation buttons to turn 90 degrees to the left or right. If "
"the rotation buttons are not displayed on the ruler, enable them with "
"<guilabel>Show rotation buttons</guilabel> in the <link linkend=\"settings-"
"dialog\">settings dialog</link>"
msgstr ""
"Klikanjem na dugmad rotacije da okrenete za 90 stepeni lijevo ili desno. Ako "
"dugmad rotacije nisu prikazana na lenjiru, omogućite ih sa <guilabel>Prikaži "
"dugmad rotacije</guilabel> u <link linkend=\"settings-dialog\">dijalogu "
"postavki</link>"

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the context menu, described in the next chapter"
msgstr "Koristeći dodatni meni, opisan u narednom odjeljku"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menu Reference"
msgstr "Referenca na izbornik"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking with the &RMB; on the ruler will pop up a context menu, with the "
"following entries:"
msgstr ""
"Klikanje na &RMB; na lenjiru će izbaciti dodatni meni, sa sljedećim "
"sadržajem:"

#. Tag: guisubmenu
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid "Orientation"
msgstr "Orijentacija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This submenu contains entries that allow you to change the orientation of "
"&kruler;"
msgstr ""
"Pod meni sadrži alate koji Vam daju mogućnost da mijenjate orjentaciju "
"&kruler;-a"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>N</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>North</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>N</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orijentacija</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Sjever</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turns &kruler; so the ruler is horizontal, and the measurements are on the "
"top (North) of the ruler"
msgstr "Okreće &kruler; horizontalno, i mjerenja su na vrhu (Sjeveru) lenjira."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>E</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>East</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>E</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orijentacija</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Istok</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turns &kruler; so the ruler is vertical, and the measurements are on the "
"right (East) of the ruler"
msgstr "Okreće &kruler; vertikalno, i mjerenja su desno (Istok) od lenjira."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>S</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>South</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>S</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orijentacija</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Jug</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turns &kruler; so the ruler is horizontal, and the measurements are on the "
"bottom (South) of the ruler"
msgstr "Okreće &kruler; horizontalno, i mjerenja su na dnu (Jug) lenjira."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>W</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>West</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>W</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orijentacija</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Zapad</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turns &kruler; so the ruler is vertical, and the measurements are on the "
"left (West) of the ruler"
msgstr "Okreće &kruler; vertikalno, i mjerenja su lijevo (Zapad) od lenjira."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>R</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Turn Right</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>R</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orijentacija</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Okreni desno</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turns the ruler 90 Degrees to the right. For example, if it is oriented "
"South, it will rotate to be oriented West."
msgstr ""
"Okreće lenjir za 90 stepeni na desno. Na primjer, ako je orijentiran južno, "
"rotirat će ga da bude orijentiran zapadno."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>L</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Turn Left</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>L</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Okreni lijevo</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turns the ruler 90 Degrees to the left. For example, if it is oriented West, "
"it will rotate to be oriented South."
msgstr ""
"Okreće lenjir za 90 stepeni na lijevo. Na primjer, ako je orijentiran "
"zapadno, rotirat će ga da bude orijentiran južno."

#. Tag: guisubmenu
#: index.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid "Length"
msgstr "Dužina"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This submenu contains entries that allow you to change the length of &kruler;"
msgstr ""
"Ovaj podmeni sadrži alate koji vam daju mogućnost da promijenite dužinu "
"lenjira."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl; <keycap>S</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guisubmenu>Length</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Short</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl; <keycap>S</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guisubmenu>Dužina</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Kratko</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "Makes &kruler; short - about 385 pixels long."
msgstr "Pravi &kruler; kratkim - oko 385 piksela dug."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>M</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guisubmenu>Length</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Medium</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>M</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guisubmenu>Dužina</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Srednje</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid "Makes &kruler; a medium length - about 640 pixels long."
msgstr "Pravi &kruler; srednje dugim - oko 640 piksela dug."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>T</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guisubmenu>Length</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Tall</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>T</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guisubmenu>Dužina</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Dugo</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid "Makes &kruler; long - about 960 pixels in length."
msgstr "Pravi &kruler; dugim - oko 960 piksela dug."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:266
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guisubmenu>Length</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Full Screen Width</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guisubmenu>Dužina</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Širina cijelog "
"zaslona</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid "Makes &kruler; the same size as your screen width."
msgstr "Pravi &kruler; iste dužine kao širina Vašeg zaslona."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:280
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guisubmenu>Length</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Length...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guisubmenu>Dužina</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Dužina...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens a dialog to enter the size in pixel."
msgstr "Otvara dijalog za unos veličine u pikselima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally, you can change the length and move the right side of the ruler "
"using the mousewheel. When holding the &Shift; key the opposite side will "
"change."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno, možete promijeniti dužinu i pomjeriti desnu stranu lenjira "
"koristeći kotačić za listanje. Kada držite tipku &Shift; promijenit će se "
"suprotna strana."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scale"
msgstr "Skaliraj"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option lets you set the ruler scale to <guilabel>Right to Left</"
"guilabel> (<keycap>D</keycap>), <guilabel>Center Origin</guilabel> "
"(<keycap>C</keycap>), <guilabel>Offset</guilabel> (<keycap>O</keycap>) and "
"<guilabel>Percentage</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Ova opcija Vam dopušta da postavite lestvicu lenjira na <guilabel>Desno na "
"lijevo</guilabel> (<keycap>D</keycap>), <guilabel>Porijeklo centra</"
"guilabel> (<keycap>C</keycap>), <guilabel>Ofset</guilabel> (<keycap>O</"
"keycap>) i <guilabel>Procenat</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:307
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Changing the offset via the mousewheel is also possible when holding the "
"&LMB;."
msgstr ""
"Mijenjanje ofseta putem kotačića za listanje je također moguće držeći &LMB;."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "Providnost"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:318
#, no-c-format
msgid "This menu item displays a slider to change the opacity of &kruler;."
msgstr ""
"Ova stavka menija prikazuje klizač za mijenjanje prozirnosti &kruler;-a."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:325
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure Shortcuts..."
msgstr "Podesi kratice..."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Configure Shortcut</guilabel> dialog allows you to assign "
"shortcuts to &kruler; actions, and configure the shortcuts already assigned."
msgstr ""
"Dijalog <guilabel>Konfiguriši kraticu</guilabel> Vam omogućava da dodijelite "
"kratice za &kruler; akcije, i konfigurišete već postavljene kratice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For more information, read the section about the <ulink url=\"help:/"
"fundamentals/config.html#shortcuts\">Shortcuts</ulink> of the &kde; "
"Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Za više informacija, pročitajte poglavlje o <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/"
"config.html#shortcuts\">Kratice</ulink> &kde; Osnove."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure &kruler;..."
msgstr "Podesi &kruler;..."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kruler;'s settings dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kruler;-ov dijalog postavki</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:352
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kruler;'s settings dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kruler;-ov dijalog postavki</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:357
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this dialog you can change the background color and font, enable rotation "
"and close buttons on the ruler and enable the tray icon."
msgstr ""
"U ovom dijalogu možete promijeniti boju pozadine i fonta, omogućiti rotaciju "
"i dugmad za izlaz na lenjiru i omogućiti ikone na programskoj traci."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenuitem>Copy Color</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenuitem>Kopiraj boju</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:372
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Copies the &HTML; color code of the color currently under the circle to the "
"clipboard."
msgstr "Kopiranje &HTML; kod boje koja je trenutno ispod kružića clipboard-a."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:378
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>W</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenuitem>Close</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>W</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenuitem>Zatvori</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:386
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Hides</action> &kruler;. It can be shown again using the icon in the "
"system tray. The context menu displays this item only when <guilabel>Show "
"tray icon</guilabel> is checked in the <link linkend=\"settings-dialog"
"\">settings dialog</link>."
msgstr ""
"<action>Sakriva</action> &kruler;. Može biti prikazan ponovo koristeći ikone "
"na programskoj traci. Kontekstni meni prikazuje ovu stavku samo kada je "
"<guilabel>Prikaži ikonu programske trake</guilabel> čekiran u <link linkend="
"\"settings-dialog\">dijalog postavki</link>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:394
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenuitem>Prekini</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:402
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Quits</action> &kruler;"
msgstr "<action>Prekida</action> &kruler;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:406
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kruler; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu item, for more "
"information read the section about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui."
"html#menus-help\">Help Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"&kruler; ima zajedničku &kde; stavku menija <guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu>, za "
"više informacija pročitajte poglavlje o <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui."
"html#menus-help\">Meni Pomoć</ulink> od &kde; Osnove."

